## SQ-PB-01
@group A, plus the jar in `srv/mods` and `-Dcdevperfbot.out=perf/bot` in `user_jvm_args.txt`
@commands Boot; `pbot status`; `pbot spawn bot1 ~ ~ ~`; `pbot list`; `forge tps`; grep latest.log for `bot1` and `Exception`
@pass `cdevperfbot ok`; a normal join line, no exception from Forge networking, FTB, KubeJS login handlers or Lightman's; bot listed
@fails NPE in a mod's login handler: that mod reads something `BotConnection` lacks (remote address, channel attribute); stack names it
@draft no batch holds this row yet
## SQ-PB-02
@group A, `gamerule randomTickSpeed 3`
@commands `fill` a 9 x 9 farmland + `wheat[age=0]` patch 10 blocks from spawn; `pbot spawn bot1` beside it; 5 min; `execute if block` count of age > 0; repeat with the bot removed
@pass Wheat grows with the bot, none without
@fails No growth: `BotPlayer.tick` chunk move not running, or the bot is in spectator
@draft no batch holds this row yet
## SQ-PB-03
@group A
@commands `pbot path bot1 <x+500> 200 <z> 1.5`; after 20 s grep `perf/bot/ticks-*.csv` for `path_done:bot1`; status lines' chunk column; `pbot census t`
@pass `path_done` after about 334 ticks; loaded chunks follow; `perf/bot/census-t.json` written
@fails Chunks don't follow: `ServerChunkCache.move` not reached
